  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SECOND AGRICULTURAL COMMERCIALISATION AND ENHANCE PROJECT RESILINCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to attain the following results (Project Development Objective (PDO)-level indicators):&#x2022; A 10% reduction in food insecure people in project targeted areas &#x2022; 13,440 (50% female) farmers adopting resilience enhancing technologies and practices &#x2022; 5, 490 hectares of land area under climate resilient and sustainable agriculture &#x2022; A 30% increase in volume of sales from Productive Alliances on domestic (10%) and regional markets (30%).</narrative>
  </description>
